#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:805
msgid ""
"The ``traceback_line_limit`` parameter of "
"``litestar.logging.config.LoggingConfig`` has been removed. This parameter "
"had no effect since version ``2.9.0``, so it can be removed safely from "
"applications without any change in behaviour."
